        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkauh Jubili kang khuan king o,",
            "Tat dat makkhe hiu bammei khuan tei;",
            "Pap phungmmei nun mu chu thui lak,",
            "Kinga guang tho nian puni the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Tat nimei tingkauh ram khou tei,",
            "Tingsang neila nban thaini;",
            "Kam thao dikho jianmei nun le,",
            "Tingkauh jubili kang khuan king o.",
            "",
            "2. Thei handat ritho lumloumei guai,",
            "Kandih hei rianra jingpui bam de;",
            "Kap kalangmei !-2 jing sini,",
            "Kauh Jubili kang khuan tei king o.",
            "",
            "3. Tang jai puni the tingkauh ram kiu,",
            "Houjai nithe kaipou Khrista lun;",
            "Halleluijah sam kan nithe,",
            "Tingkauh guang jubili ngai khang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
